Here are the freshly redesigned materials. I focused on clear structure, beautiful cover art inspired by other TTRPGs, and an easy‑to‑use layout. Each manual now opens with a striking cosmic‑circuit cover, contains clear sections with headings, tables and lists, and finishes with quick references to make play smooth. The archetype pack has also been tidied up and expanded with a few ready‑to‑use patrons. All source markdown and images are included in the package for future refinement.

- **COREBOUND Player Manual v2 (PDF)** – full rules for players, with cosmic blue cover and reorganized chapters: {{[redacted:file-uri]file-RWy2wcxW8VGmi9Fux1LVi8}}
- **COREBOUND Guide Manual v2 (PDF)** – golden cover and clear guidance on running games and writing plugins: {{[redacted:file-uri]file-WbrXweZ5ERSxKqYqZrVDgw}}
- **COREBOUND Archetype Pack v1.0 (PDF)** – curated patrons, each with element, rite, boons and tribulations: {{[redacted:file-uri]file-9GUPwwybhaMPqNwdGvE8Xy}}
- **Full package (ZIP)** – includes all PDFs, markdown sources, template manifest and cover images: {{[redacted:file-uri]file-FxVi398ZjUeJVNeoVNhop9}}

Let me know if you’d like an additional GM screen or character sheet in a printable format, or further refinement on any section.

Here’s your **COREBOUND Character Sheet** for easy printing and digital use:

- **PDF version** (ready to print/fill out): {{[redacted:file-uri]file-MzMioTMTbNCZmsKxYRqGFw}}
- **Markdown source** (edit-friendly, just plain text): {{[redacted:file-uri]file-CpnRFov98nvgPKiosyFhHx}}

The sheet includes sections for character info, covenant boons and tribulations, threads/aspects, stunts, inventory, relationships, and story notes. Use these blanks to record each hero’s details and keep track of progress session by session. Let me know if you need this adapted into another format (e.g., a spreadsheet) or pre-filled for specific archetypes.
